---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<section class="relative py-16 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5 bg-space-900/10">
  <!-- Glowing orb specific to this section -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 left-0 w-[300px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-blue-500/5 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl px-6 sm:px-12 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16 xl:gap-24">
    <!-- Text Content (Right on Large screens) -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col gap-6 animate-fade-in-up">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400">Rumbo al Liderazgo</span>
        <h2 class="font-extrabold text-white mt-2 mb-6 leading-tight text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-left">
          Nuestra Visión
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
          Ser reconocidos como líderes en la industria, destacándonos por nuestra excelencia en diseño de experiencia de usuarios, desarrollo y soporte de sitios web. Aspiramos a ser la primera opción para empresas que buscan servicios innovadores, rápidos y confiables, con un enfoque constante en la calidad y la mejora continua. Visualizamos un futuro donde cada negocio pueda aprovechar plenamente el potencial de la tecnología digital con nuestra ayuda.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Valores Clave Cards -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50 mb-1">Nuestros Valores Clave</h3>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <!-- Rapidez -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-fuchsia-500/30 hover:bg-fuchsia-500/5 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-fuchsia-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-fuchsia-400 mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base mb-1">Rapidez</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
              Priorizamos la entrega puntual de proyectos sin comprometer la calidad.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Confiabilidad -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-blue-500/5 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base mb-1">Confianza</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
              Relaciones sólidas mediante soporte técnico continuo y soluciones estables.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Calidad -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/30 hover:bg-cyan-500/5 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base mb-1">Calidad</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
              Excelencia en diseño, desarrollo y soporte post-lanzamiento.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Image Composition (Left on Large screens) -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex justify-center items-center animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-[450px]">
        <!-- Decorative glowing borders behind image -->
        <div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-500 to-blue-500 opacity-20 blur-lg group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-1000"></div>
        
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden bg-space-850">
          <Image
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
            src="/images/vision.jpg"
            width={450}
            height={450}
            loading="lazy"
            alt="Visión de VETEK SO"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Overlapping Glass Card 1 -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 md:-right-10 p-4 rounded-xl bg-space-900/90 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3 animate-float-medium">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs text-white/50">Desarrollo</div>
            <div class="font-extrabold text-white text-sm">Tecnología de Punta</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
